OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 21 MAR
OL,4,G1300FMusic Matters
OL,5,     GMark Radcliffe discusses his
OL,6,     Gfavourite choral music, from his
OL,7,     Gearly exposure to Handel's
OL,8,     GMessiah, through to works by
OL,9,     GGorecki, Tallis and James
OL,10,     GMacMillan.
OL,11,G1400FRecord Review
OL,12,     GA thorough look at the week's
OL,13,     Gclassical music releases, plus
OL,14,     Gnews and the Radio 3 Disc of the
OL,15,     GWeek recommendation.
OL,16,G1600FSound Of Cinema
OL,17,     GEdith Bowman brings you a weekly
OL,18,     Gselection of the best film scores
OL,19,     Gand movie music - featuring
OL,20,     Gcomposer Danny Elfman talking
OL,21,     Gabout his score to Gus Van Sant's
OL,22,     GDead Man's Wire.
